### Page content (from check + KS sources)

- **Purpose:** Cap horizontal visible actions at **3** (`MAX_VISIBLE_HORIZONTAL_ACTIONS` in `det-button-group-max.check.js`); targets `.landing-hero-actions__buttons`, `.btn-group`, flex rows in `main`, etc.; excludes nav/pagination/cookie chrome.
- **Passing / failing signals:** Aligned with `buttonGroupMaxReport`, severity major/critical when count > max+1.
- **Before:** Five `.btn` siblings in `landing-hero-actions__buttons` (fails).
- **After:** Two buttons (`btn-forge`, `btn-cyan-outline`) plus `landing-hero-secondary-links` / `landing-hero-secondary-link` / `landing-hero-secondary-sep` (passes).
- **Evidence & remediation:** `metrics.buttonGroupMaxReport`, ordered hero/toolbar fixes, ties to `DET.CTA.HIERARCHY` and `DET.CONTEXT.BURDEN`.

